><p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Bright Bawa</strong></p><p><strong style=\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">IT Manager.</strong></p><p><br></p></div>"}', 'action': 'Save', 'cmd': 'frappe.desk.form.save.savedocs'}
